                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">apprehension</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">is</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">desired.</del> You will take all possible
                        steps <hi rendition="#italic">in your zone</hi> to apprehend <del
                            rendition="#strikethrough">the</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">persons</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">named</del>
                        <del rendition="#strikethrough">is</del>
